{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c82b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a800-dff5-7ec3-9e60-f73779a17ae8"},"sequence":624,"recorded_at":1780531400001243,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a802-78fd-77e0-b948-cd978c2c3e04"},"task_id":"01a0a802-78fd-77e0-b948-cd978c2c3e04","event":{"kind":"completed","task_id":"01a0a802-78fd-77e0-b948-cd978c2c3e04"}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c82d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a800-dff5-7ec3-9e60-f73779a17ae8"},"sequence":625,"recorded_at":1780531400001245,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1"},"call_id":"call_01a0a80270ae762f9919711624a0c9bd","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-15-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -r \\\"\\\\.spec\\\" /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/ --include=\\\"*.md\\\" 2>&1 | head -n 20\\ngrep -r \\\"registration\\\" /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/ 2>&1 | head -n 40\\n# Check story tasks descriptions\\ntask-board q 'get(TASK-260916-13diw4) { id title }' 2>&1\\n# try to get full board file\\nls -R /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/ 2>&1 | head -n 40\",\n  \"description\": \"Search spec and registration refs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:**What**: Implements evaluation/trial expiry detection. On app startup and login, reads `isEvaluationDisabled` boolean from `GET /users/me` response. If `true`, shows a one-time global alert (\\\"Evaluation finished — contact support@xflow.org\\\") with a \\\"Copy email\\\" button. Persists the flag in `UserDefaultsManager` for diagnostics and displays it in Settings as a status badge. Also includes a `.spec/xfl-59-evaluation-status.md` spec document describing the backend contract and expected behavior. 75 lines across 9 files.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:- What's missing: **No spec-driven feature scaffolding.** This commit includes a `.spec/xfl-59-evaluation-status.md` file that describes the feature requirements and backend contract. This is the first time we see a spec document in the repo. The pattern of \\\"spec file → implementation\\\" could be supported by ios-app-manager — a command that reads a structured spec and scaffolds the boilerplate (model field, UserDefaults key, L10n entries, alert plumbing). However, this is very aspirational.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:- Suggested solution: N/A for now. The spec file pattern (`.spec/` directory with feature specs) is good practice regardless of tooling. More practical: the repeated pattern of \\\"global one-time alert with support email + copy button\\\" (seen in both XFL-59 and XFL-60) could be a reusable component scaffolded by a utility.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:5. **Spec document**: `.spec/xfl-60-account-suspended.md` (22 lines) describing the feature requirements.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:- **Ivan Oparin (ivan@relux.works) is the primary contributor** — 7 of 10 commits. He handles: widget deep links, evaluation status (with spec), account suspension (with spec), and account deletion. Aleksandr Chechenev does Apple Sign-In. The `.spec/` directory pattern (seen in d2bbd0e and a2d7c3e) appears to be Ivan's practice — writing structured specs before implementation.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/.research/xflow/connect-ios-audit/batch-08.md:- **The `.spec/` directory is promising.** Two specs in this batch (`xfl-59-evaluation-status.md`, `xfl-60-account-suspended.md`) show a pattern of writing structured requirements before implementation. The specs are concise (15-22 lines), focused, and include backend contracts. This is good engineering practice, though the specs are not referenced by the code — they're purely for human readers.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-13diw4/approved-design.md:«Создать новый runner» в первой версии — пошаговая инструкция регистрации в GitHub и последующее добавление выбранной папки. Полная загрузка/регистрация через приложение — следующий этап с отдельными правами и краткоживущим registration token.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-13diw4/approved-design.md:| GitHub API | Online/offline, busy, registration ID, labels | Мгновенное состояние процесса, гарантированное отсутствие новой job после ответа |\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-13diw4/approved-design.md:- GitHubObserver: отдельно сопоставляет local registration и API runner по server + scope + remote ID, не по имени. При неоднозначности не прикрепляет случайный runner.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-3uyl05/approved-design.md:«Создать новый runner» в первой версии — пошаговая инструкция регистрации в GitHub и последующее добавление выбранной папки. Полная загрузка/регистрация через приложение — следующий этап с отдельными правами и краткоживущим registration token.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-3uyl05/approved-design.md:| GitHub API | Online/offline, busy, registration ID, labels | Мгновенное состояние процесса, гарантированное отсутствие новой job после ответа |\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-3uyl05/approved-design.md:- GitHubObserver: отдельно сопоставляет local registration и API runner по server + scope + remote ID, не по имени. При неоднозначности не прикрепляет случайный runner.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-2vzsmy/approved-design.md:«Создать новый runner» в первой версии — пошаговая инструкция регистрации в GitHub и последующее добавление выбранной папки. Полная загрузка/регистрация через приложение — следующий этап с отдельными правами и краткоживущим registration token.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-2vzsmy/approved-design.md:| GitHub API | Online/offline, busy, registration ID, labels | Мгновенное состояние процесса, гарантированное отсутствие новой job после ответа |\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-2vzsmy/approved-design.md:- GitHubObserver: отдельно сопоставляет local registration и API runner по server + scope + remote ID, не по имени. При неоднозначности не прикрепляет случайный runner.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-97dhxd/approved-design.md:«Создать новый runner» в первой версии — пошаговая инструкция регистрации в GitHub и последующее добавление выбранной папки. Полная загрузка/регистрация через приложение — следующий этап с отдельными правами и краткоживущим registration token.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-97dhxd/approved-design.md:| GitHub API | Online/offline, busy, registration ID, labels | Мгновенное состояние процесса, гарантированное отсутствие новой job после ответа |\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-97dhxd/approved-design.md:- GitHubObserver: отдельно сопоставляет local registration и API runner по server + scope + remote ID, не по имени. При неоднозначности не прикрепляет случайный runner.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-97dhxd/delivery-plan.md:Approved delivery: Story universal management has three sequential vertical slices: login/window, registration/access, catalog/lifecycle. Each producer is Muse Spark 1.3 max; each review Astra low or Fable 5.1 low, followed by producer-bound integration. Independent release Story repairs CI first, then publishes only after product integration. Final acceptance is public signed notarized DMG and signed Sparkle appcast. User approved autonomous implementation and release. GitHub App provisioning handled by coordinator; browser reauthentication pending. No UI tests.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-304bw2/approved-design.md:«Создать новый runner» в первой версии — пошаговая инструкция регистрации в GitHub и последующее добавление выбранной папки. Полная загрузка/регистрация через приложение — следующий этап с отдельными правами и краткоживущим registration token.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-304bw2/approved-design.md:| GitHub API | Online/offline, busy, registration ID, labels | Мгновенное состояние процесса, гарантированное отсутствие новой job после ответа |\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-304bw2/approved-design.md:- GitHubObserver: отдельно сопоставляет local registration и API runner по server + scope + remote ID, не по имени. При неоднозначности не прикрепляет случайный runner.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-1o0gkc_signed-notarized-release/TASK-260916-3uyl05_release-ci-signing-and-notary/progress.md:- [approved-design.md](file://TASK-260916-3uyl05/approved-design.md) — Existing design; task brief promotes registration and removal into this release\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-1o0gkc_signed-notarized-release/TASK-260916-2vzsmy_validate-and-publish-release/progress.md:- [approved-design.md](file://TASK-260916-2vzsmy/approved-design.md) — Existing design; task brief promotes registration and removal into this release\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-1o0gkc_signed-notarized-release/TASK-260916-2vzsmy_validate-and-publish-release/README.md:After both application and release automation are accepted and integrated, perform full release validation, tag new version and run release CI to a published GitHub release. Verify DMG Developer ID signature/notary staple, appcast signature/version/download links and downloadable assets. Coordinate real GitHub App binding and controlled registration smoke with coordinator. Record release URL and build evidence. User explicitly authorizes public release. Never fake notarization success or publish incomplete assets. Repo is public relux-works/runner-control; bundle works.relux.runnercontrol, team 262RZ595FP. Read precondition design and current source. Use /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/SKILL.md, work/skills/skill-swift-relux/SKILL.md and work/skills/skill-ios-testing-tools/agents/skills/ios-testing-tools/SKILL.md under that same workspace. No UI tests. Keep Relux actor services, state/reducer/flow, Container+Page. Modify generator input, never hand-edit generated Project.swift or Package.swift. Do not stop, re-register or interrupt any existing production runner. Do not commit producer changes; hand off candidate through task-board. No new delegates without coordinator direction.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-13diw4_register-mac-and-repository-access/progress.md:- [approved-design.md](file://TASK-260916-13diw4/approved-design.md) — Existing design; task brief promotes registration and removal into this release\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-13diw4_register-mac-and-repository-access/README.md:Implement new-runner wizard through GitHub API: architecture-matched official download with integrity verification, no-space install/work directories, scoped short-lived registration token, exact config invocation, runsvc.sh setup, manual LaunchAgent, idempotent retries and recovery. Organization registration uses a dedicated per-Mac group and selected repo access; personal repos get separate installations. Allow editing repository access and labels. Fetch real IDs and retain permissions errors. Do not mutate unrelated/shared groups without explicit UI scope. Use production services with controlled filesystem/transport tests. Repo is public relux-works/runner-control; bundle works.relux.runnercontrol, team 262RZ595FP. Read precondition design and current source. Use /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/SKILL.md, work/skills/skill-swift-relux/SKILL.md and work/skills/skill-ios-testing-tools/agents/skills/ios-testing-tools/SKILL.md under that same workspace. No UI tests. Keep Relux actor services, state/reducer/flow, Container+Page. Modify generator input, never hand-edit generated Project.swift or Package.swift. Do not stop, re-register or interrupt any existing production runner. Do not commit producer changes; hand off candidate through task-board. No new delegates without coordinator direction.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-13diw4_register-mac-and-repository-access/README.md:Wizard can register this Mac for org or repo without terminal; selected repositories are applied and can be changed; failed/repeated operations avoid orphan/duplicate registrations; no secret leakage; tests exercise actual entry points.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-304bw2_catalog-lifecycle-and-polished-ui/progress.md:- [approved-design.md](file://TASK-260916-304bw2/approved-design.md) — Existing design; task brief promotes registration and removal into this release\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-97dhxd_github-login-and-management-window/progress.md:- [approved-design.md](file://TASK-260916-97dhxd/approved-design.md) — Existing design; task brief promotes registration and removal into this release\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/TASK-260916-97dhxd_github-login-and-management-window/README.md:Implement the first runnable vertical slice: native management window, GitHub App Device Flow login/logout with Keychain and serialized token refresh, installation/account listing and repository selection. Local control remains usable offline. Never embed client secrets, App private keys, or tokens in state/logs. Public client ID will be provisioned by coordinator; model app config cleanly, report exact missing binding. Add focused transport and Keychain tests. Materialize approved design into .spec with registration and removal now in scope. Repo is public relux-works/runner-control; bundle works.relux.runnercontrol, team 262RZ595FP. Read precondition design and current source. Use /Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/work/skills/skill-ios-app-manager/SKILL.md, work/skills/skill-swift-relux/SKILL.md and work/skills/skill-ios-testing-tools/agents/skills/ios-testing-tools/SKILL.md under that same workspace. No UI tests. Keep Relux actor services, state/reducer/flow, Container+Page. Modify generator input, never hand-edit generated Project.swift or Package.swift. Do not stop, re-register or interrupt any existing production runner. Do not commit producer changes; hand off candidate through task-board. No new delegates without coordinator direction.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/EPIC-260916-3oqyia_runner-control-universal-release/STORY-260916-36d1jg_universal-runner-management/README.md:GitHub login, registration, repository access, catalog import and safe lifecycle work without hardcoded machines or accounts.\\n/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.activity/TASK-260916-13diw4/events.ndjson:{\\\"version\\\":\\\"activity-event.v1\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"AEV-260916-3ceaab7d98fa625be3d1695a\\\",\\\"sequence\\\":5,\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-09-16T02:14:00.326996Z\\\",\\\"actor\\\":{\\\"principal\\\":{\\\"availability\\\":\\\"unknown\\\"},\\\"agent\\\":{\\\"availability\\\":\\\"known\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"codex\\\"},\\\"run\\\":{\\\"availability\\\":\\\"unknown\\\"},\\\"session\\\":{\\\"availability\\\":\\\"known\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"01a0a685-13ae-7cb2-9a77-fcaaeb7dbeef\\\"},\\\"operator\\\":{\\\"availability\\\":\\\"unknown\\\"}},\\\"subject\\\":{\\\"element_id\\\":\\\"TASK-260916-13diw4\\\",\\\"element_type\\\":\\