{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dc1f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a800-dff5-7ec3-9e60-f73779a17ae8"},"sequence":3178,"recorded_at":1780531400006351,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5bfa53ee-3974-4b46-9ee1-e5a5376687f1"},"terminal":"completed","text":"GitHub login + management window slice is ready for review (handed off to review, board `to-review`, 14/14 checks, 2 outcome artifacts).\n\nWhat shipped (uncommitted candidate, branch tip untouched at `7d2126a`):\n- Core `GitHubAuth` Relux module: state/reducer/flow/module, Device Flow transport (`requestCode`/`pollOnce`, slow_down +5s), REST client (`/user`, installations, repos), single-flight `GitHubTokenRefresh`, Keychain store (`<host>:<userID>:<clientID>`), `PATGuard`, `RESTMapper` (401/403/429), `Redaction`, `AppConfig` with exact missing binding `Info.plist[GitHubAppClientID] via ios-app-manager.json macos.info_plist.GitHubAppClientID`.\n- App: 760×540 management window (Runners/GitHub/General tabs) via `ManagementWindowContainer/Page`, reopen + menu \"Раннеры и настройки…\" (no new delegate), launch-at-login, Sparkle settings; menu bar popover unchanged in behavior.\n- Generator input only: `ios-app-manager.json` gains empty `GitHubAppClientID` placeholder for coordinator provisioning; `Project.swift`/`Package.swift` not hand-edited.\n- `.spec/` with login, window, registration, removal (promoted in scope), and offline specs.\n\nVerification observed:\n- `swift test --package-path Packages/RunnerControlCore`: exit 0, 45/45 passed; skill script run also exit 0 with JUnit/logs.\n- `tuist generate`, Release `xcodebuild` (BUILD SUCCEEDED), `codesign --verify --deep --strict`: exit 0; bundle `works.relux.runnercontrol` 1.1.1.\n- `swift